<p>To honor the iPod, Apple has placed a first-generation iPod (loaded with music&#8230; previews!) <a href="https://music.apple.com/thisisanipod">on its &#8220;page not found&#8221; page</a>.</p>
<p>It&#8217;s a thorough emulation, right down to the era-specific preloaded music and the &#8220;secret&#8221; breakout game.</p>
<p>Check it out—but be sure to open the URL directly in Safari, because it doesn&#8217;t work if you click the link, which goes straight to the Apple Music app.</p>
